  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1176763/description_949a6ac0-5330-42f2-a5b5-cce1b8532c27.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"868\" height=\"511\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4FsYv7RyMq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1176763/description_e46171aa-95d7-4849-9583-670ab2301144.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"30\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1176763/description_5ba8927c-6cb6-4513-b686-16e6e9f30199.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1176763/description_f7ce0150-68d9-4e52-af8b-09425c8204c5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"192\" height=\"108\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1176763/description_c6b90182-d1db-452d-ba4b-52b10cfa3850.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Вот несколько демонстраций механики:</p><div style=\"display:flex\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"display:flex\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1176763/description_c134619c-9054-4eb6-a97a-d42cf9fbb22b.gif\" alt=\"Демо 1\" width=\"279\" height=\"157\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1176763/description_334aa2a0-dc2e-48b3-84e0-b7c32b585447.gif\" alt=\"Демо 2\" width=\"280\" height=\"179\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1176763/description_fa03c2df-a353-41ed-ba89-d1ccc861939d.gif\" alt=\"Демо 3\" width=\"280\" height=\"180\"></div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><br>Анимации замахов из мода&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>Этот мод содержит многие функции <strong>Project: War Dance</strong>; если вам нужна версия для 1.20.1,<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-war-dance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> взгляните </a>:)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Сделано с ❤️ и ☕</p>",
